			<div class="textwidget"><p>Training tips, gear reviews, proven nutrition, and more. If you are serious about your training, you are going to seriously love this place.<br />
<a class="button" href="articles">Read the Blog</a></p>
</div>
		</div></section>
</div></div></div><div id="front-page-2" class="front-page-2"><div class="flexible-widgets widget-area widget-full"><div class="wrap"><section id="text-2" class="widget widget_text"><div class="widget-wrap">			<div class="textwidget"><p><img fetchpriority="high" decoding="async" class="alignleft size-full wp-image-1109" src="https://www.yourworkoutbook.com/wp-content/uploads/2015/04/as-seen-in-YWB.png" alt="" width="1081" height="153" srcset="https://www.yourworkoutbook.com/wp-content/uploads/2015/04/as-seen-in-YWB.png 1081w, https://www.yourworkoutbook.com/wp-content/uploads/2015/04/as-seen-in-YWB-300x42.png 300w, https://www.yourworkoutbook.com/wp-content/uploads/2015/04/as-seen-in-YWB-1024x145.png 1024w, https://www.yourworkoutbook.com/wp-content/uploads/2015/04/as-seen-in-YWB-768x109.png 768w" sizes="(max-width: 1081px) 100vw, 1081px" /></p>
<p>At YourWorkoutBook.com, we are dedicated to helping individuals achieve their fitness goals. We provide unbiased reviews of fitness equipment and offer expert exercise tips.</p>
<p>Our mission is to simplify the process of choosing the right equipment and provide valuable guidance for a healthier and fitter lifestyle. Join us as we support and inspire your fitness journey.</p>
</div>
		</div></section>
</div></div></div><div id="front-page-3" class="front-page-3"><div class="widget-area"><div class="wrap"><section id="text-7" class="widget widget_text"><div class="widget-wrap">			<div class="textwidget"><p>&nbsp;</p>
<h2><center>MOST RECENT ARTICLES</center></h2>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
</div>
		</div></section>
</div></div></div><div id="front-page-4" class="front-page-4"><div class="flexible-widgets widget-area widget-halves uneven"><div class="wrap"><section id="featured-post-6" class="widget featured-content featuredpost"><div class="widget-wrap"><article class="post-14439 post type-post status-publish format-standard has-post-thumbnail category-lifting-accessories category-strength entry" aria-label="5 Ways to Pad the Barbell When Doing Hip Thrusts"><a href="https://www.yourworkoutbook.com/how-to-pad-the-barbell-when-doing-hip-thrusts/" class="alignnone" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"><img width="1024" height="555" src="https://www.yourworkoutbook.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/11/How-to-Pad-Barbell-When-Doing-Hip-Thrusts-1024x555.jpg" class="entry-image attachment-post" alt="How to Pad Barbell When Doing Hip Thrusts" itemprop="image" decoding="async" loading="lazy" srcset="https://www.yourworkoutbook.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/11/How-to-Pad-Barbell-When-Doing-Hip-Thrusts-1024x555.jpg 1024w, https://www.yourworkoutbook.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/11/How-to-Pad-Barbell-When-Doing-Hip-Thrusts-300x163.jpg 300w, https://www.yourworkoutbook.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/11/How-to-Pad-Barbell-When-Doing-Hip-Thrusts-768x416.jpg 768w, https://www.yourworkoutbook.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/11/How-to-Pad-Barbell-When-Doing-Hip-Thrusts.jpg 1200w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px" /></a><header class="entry-header"><h4 class="entry-title" itemprop="headline"><a href="https://www.yourworkoutbook.com/how-to-pad-the-barbell-when-doing-hip-thrusts/">5 Ways to Pad the Barbell When Doing Hip Thrusts</a></h4></header><div class="entry-content"><p>By padding the barbell, you can focus on lifting more weight, proper technique, and reducing painful bruising. Here are some effective ways to protect your hips when doing hip thrusts.</p>
</div></article><article class="post-14381 post type-post status-publish format-standard has-post-thumbnail category-lifting-accessories category-strength entry" aria-label="6 Best Barbell Squat Pads (Squat in Comfort)"><a href="https://www.yourworkoutbook.com/best-barbell-squat-pads/" class="alignnone" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"><img width="1024" height="683" src="https://www.yourworkoutbook.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/11/The-Best-Barbell-Squat-Pads-1024x683.jpg" class="entry-image attachment-post" alt="The Best Barbell Squat Pads" itemprop="image" decoding="async" loading="lazy" srcset="https://www.yourworkoutbook.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/11/The-Best-Barbell-Squat-Pads-1024x683.jpg 1024w, https://www.yourworkoutbook.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/11/The-Best-Barbell-Squat-Pads-300x200.jpg 300w, https://www.yourworkoutbook.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/11/The-Best-Barbell-Squat-Pads-768x512.jpg 768w, https://www.yourworkoutbook.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/11/The-Best-Barbell-Squat-Pads-600x400.jpg 600w, https://www.yourworkoutbook.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/11/The-Best-Barbell-Squat-Pads.jpg 1200w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px" /></a><header class="entry-header"><h4 class="entry-title" itemprop="headline"><a href="https://www.yourworkoutbook.com/best-barbell-squat-pads/">6 Best Barbell Squat Pads (Squat in Comfort)</a></h4></header><div class="entry-content"><p>Fed up with neck pain and bruising from barbell squats? Here is a look at the best barbell squat pads for squatting in comfort. </p>
</div></article><article class="post-14327 post type-post status-publish format-standard has-post-thumbnail category-cardio category-guides-treadmills category-treadmills entry" aria-label="Study: What are the Most Popular Treadmill Brands?"><a href="https://www.yourworkoutbook.com/most-popular-treadmill-brands-study/" class="alignnone" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"><img width="1024" height="576" src="https://www.yourworkoutbook.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/09/Most-Popular-Treadmill-Brands-Study-1024x576.jpg" class="entry-image attachment-post" alt="Most Popular Treadmill Brands" itemprop="image" decoding="async" loading="lazy" srcset="https://www.yourworkoutbook.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/09/Most-Popular-Treadmill-Brands-Study-1024x576.jpg 1024w, https://www.yourworkoutbook.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/09/Most-Popular-Treadmill-Brands-Study-300x169.jpg 300w, https://www.yourworkoutbook.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/09/Most-Popular-Treadmill-Brands-Study-768x432.jpg 768w, https://www.yourworkoutbook.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/09/Most-Popular-Treadmill-Brands-Study.jpg 1200w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px" /></a><header class="entry-header"><h4 class="entry-title" itemprop="headline"><a href="https://www.yourworkoutbook.com/most-popular-treadmill-brands-study/">Study: What are the Most Popular Treadmill Brands?</a></h4></header><div class="entry-content"><p>Curious what treadmill brand is the most popular for home gyms? We break down the data to examine which treadmill and treadmill brand people love most. </p>
</div></article><article class="post-14276 post type-post status-publish format-standard has-post-thumbnail category-cardio category-ellipticals category-reviews entry" aria-label="6 Best Ellipticals for Tall People (No More Straining or Stooping)"><a href="https://www.yourworkoutbook.com/best-ellipticals-for-tall-people/" class="alignnone" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"><img width="1024" height="576" src="https://www.yourworkoutbook.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/07/Best-Ellipticals-for-Tall-People-1024x576.jpg" class="entry-image attachment-post" alt="Best Ellipticals for Tall People" itemprop="image" decoding="async" loading="lazy" srcset="https://www.yourworkoutbook.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/07/Best-Ellipticals-for-Tall-People-1024x576.jpg 1024w, https://www.yourworkoutbook.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/07/Best-Ellipticals-for-Tall-People-300x169.jpg 300w, https://www.yourworkoutbook.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/07/Best-Ellipticals-for-Tall-People-768x432.jpg 768w, https://www.yourworkoutbook.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/07/Best-Ellipticals-for-Tall-People.jpg 1200w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px" /></a><header class="entry-header"><h4 class="entry-title" itemprop="headline"><a href="https://www.yourworkoutbook.com/best-ellipticals-for-tall-people/">6 Best Ellipticals for Tall People (No More Straining or Stooping)</a></h4></header><div class="entry-content"><p>Looking for the best elliptical for tall people? Read on for ellipticals with superior stride lengths, ergonomic designs, and adjustable features perfect for taller users. Ellipticals are low-impact cardio machines that simulate walking, running, and stepping, minimizing impact on joints and maximizing calorie burn. Ellipticals use fixed (or in some cases, adjustable) foot pedals and [&hellip;]</p>
</div></article><article class="post-14132 post type-post status-publish format-standard has-post-thumbnail category-gear category-nutrition entry" aria-label="Beyond Body Book Review – A Truly Customized Weight Loss Plan?"><a href="https://www.yourworkoutbook.com/beyond-body-book-review/" class="alignnone" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"><img width="1024" height="576" src="https://www.yourworkoutbook.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/06/Beyond-Body-Review-1024x576.jpg" class="entry-image attachment-post" alt="Beyond Body Review" itemprop="image" decoding="async" loading="lazy" srcset="https://www.yourworkoutbook.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/06/Beyond-Body-Review-1024x576.jpg 1024w, https://www.yourworkoutbook.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/06/Beyond-Body-Review-300x169.jpg 300w, https://www.yourworkoutbook.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/06/Beyond-Body-Review-768x432.jpg 768w, https://www.yourworkoutbook.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/06/Beyond-Body-Review.jpg 1200w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px" /></a><header class="entry-header"><h4 class="entry-title" itemprop="headline"><a href="https://www.yourworkoutbook.com/beyond-body-book-review/">Beyond Body Book Review – A Truly Customized Weight Loss Plan?</a></h4></header><div class="entry-content"><p>Beyond Body is a tailor-made nutrition plan that promises to help you lose weight. But is it all it’s cracked up to be? In this review of Beyond Body, we examine the book and its claims.</p>
</div></article><article class="post-14038 post type-post status-publish format-standard has-post-thumbnail category-exercises category-pull-ups entry" aria-label="9 Benefits of Pull-Ups (Defy Gravity and Build Strength and Muscle)"><a href="https://www.yourworkoutbook.com/benefits-of-pull-ups/" class="alignnone" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"><img width="1024" height="576" src="https://www.yourworkoutbook.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/06/Benefits-of-Pull-Ups-1024x576.jpg" class="entry-image attachment-post" alt="Benefits of Pull-Ups" itemprop="image" decoding="async" loading="lazy" srcset="https://www.yourworkoutbook.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/06/Benefits-of-Pull-Ups-1024x576.jpg 1024w, https://www.yourworkoutbook.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/06/Benefits-of-Pull-Ups-300x169.jpg 300w, https://www.yourworkoutbook.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/06/Benefits-of-Pull-Ups-768x432.jpg 768w, https://www.yourworkoutbook.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/06/Benefits-of-Pull-Ups.jpg 1200w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px" /></a><header class="entry-header"><h4 class="entry-title" itemprop="headline"><a href="https://www.yourworkoutbook.com/benefits-of-pull-ups/">9 Benefits of Pull-Ups (Defy Gravity and Build Strength and Muscle)</a></h4></header><div class="entry-content"><p>Pull-ups are pound-for-pound one of the best exercises you can do! Learn the full range of benefits of pull-ups, from strengthening the upper body muscles to improving posture and functional fitness.</p>
</div></article><article class="post-13887 post type-post status-publish format-standard has-post-thumbnail category-cardio category-reviews-treadmills category-treadmills entry" aria-label="The Best Commercial Treadmills – Gym-Grade Treadmills for Home Use"><a href="https://www.yourworkoutbook.com/best-commercial-treadmills/" class="alignnone" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"><img width="1024" height="576" src="https://www.yourworkoutbook.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/06/Best-Commercial-Treadmills-for-Home-Use-1024x576.jpg" class="entry-image attachment-post" alt="Best Commercial Treadmills for Home Use" itemprop="image" decoding="async" loading="lazy" srcset="https://www.yourworkoutbook.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/06/Best-Commercial-Treadmills-for-Home-Use-1024x576.jpg 1024w, https://www.yourworkoutbook.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/06/Best-Commercial-Treadmills-for-Home-Use-300x169.jpg 300w, https://www.yourworkoutbook.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/06/Best-Commercial-Treadmills-for-Home-Use-768x432.jpg 768w, https://www.yourworkoutbook.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/06/Best-Commercial-Treadmills-for-Home-Use.jpg 1200w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px" /></a><header class="entry-header"><h4 class="entry-title" itemprop="headline"><a href="https://www.yourworkoutbook.com/best-commercial-treadmills/">The Best Commercial Treadmills – Gym-Grade Treadmills for Home Use</a></h4></header><div class="entry-content"><p>Commercial grade treadmills offer the ultimate in durability and performance. Here’s a look at the best commercial treadmills for home use, how to choose, and more.</p>
</div></article><article class="post-13866 post type-post status-publish format-standard has-post-thumbnail category-cardio category-reviews-treadmills category-treadmills entry" aria-label="Sole F63 vs Sole F65 – Which One is Best for Your Home Gym?"><a href="https://www.yourworkoutbook.com/sole-f63-vs-f65-treadmills/" class="alignnone" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"><img width="1024" height="576" src="https://www.yourworkoutbook.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/06/Sole-F63-vs-Sole-F65-Treadmills-Differences-and-Which-One-is-Best-for-You-1024x576.jpg" class="entry-image attachment-post" alt="Sole F63 vs Sole F65 Treadmills - Differences and Which One is Best for You" itemprop="image" decoding="async" loading="lazy" srcset="https://www.yourworkoutbook.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/06/Sole-F63-vs-Sole-F65-Treadmills-Differences-and-Which-One-is-Best-for-You-1024x576.jpg 1024w, https://www.yourworkoutbook.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/06/Sole-F63-vs-Sole-F65-Treadmills-Differences-and-Which-One-is-Best-for-You-300x169.jpg 300w, https://www.yourworkoutbook.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/06/Sole-F63-vs-Sole-F65-Treadmills-Differences-and-Which-One-is-Best-for-You-768x432.jpg 768w, https://www.yourworkoutbook.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/06/Sole-F63-vs-Sole-F65-Treadmills-Differences-and-Which-One-is-Best-for-You.jpg 1200w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px" /></a><header class="entry-header"><h4 class="entry-title" itemprop="headline"><a href="https://www.yourworkoutbook.com/sole-f63-vs-f65-treadmills/">Sole F63 vs Sole F65 – Which One is Best for Your Home Gym?</a></h4></header><div class="entry-content"><p>The Sole F63 and F65 are the two most budget-friendly Sole treadmills for home gyms. But which one is right for you? In this comparison, we test and contrast so you can choose with confidence. </p>
</div></article></div></section>
